{"suttaId":"tha-ap163","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6648,6667],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap163:0.3":"Supāricariyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap163:1.1":"“Padumo nāma nāmena, dvipadindo narāsabho;","tha-ap163:1.3":"Pavanā abhinikkhamma, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap163:2.1":"“Yakkhānaṃ samayo āsi, avidūre mahesino;","tha-ap163:2.3":"Yena kiccena sampattā, ajjhāpekkhiṃsu tāvade.","tha-ap163:3.1":"“Buddhassa giramaññāya, amatassa ca desanaṃ;","tha-ap163:3.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, apphoṭetvā upaṭṭhahiṃ.","tha-ap163:4.1":"“Suciṇṇassa phalaṃ passa, upaṭṭhānassa satthuno;","tha-ap163:4.3":"Tiṃsakappasahassesu, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap163:5.1":"“Ūnatiṃse kappasate, samalaṅkatanāmako;","tha-ap163:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap163:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap163:6.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap163:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā supāricariyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap163:8.1":"Supāricariyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3078,"to":3078,"paras":[{"para":3078,"vripara":"1","refs":["tha-ap163:1"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumo nāma nāmenā</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>padumo</b>ti yassa pādanikkhepasamaye pathaviṃ bhinditvā padumaṃ uggantvā pādatalaṃ sampaṭicchati, tena saññāṇena so bhagavā padumoti saṅkhaṃ gato, idha padumuttaro bhagavā adhippeto.","So bhagavā <b>pavanā</b> vasanavihārā <b>abhinikkhamma</b> vanamajjhaṃ pavisitvā dhammaṃ desetīti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap163:1"],["tha-ap163:1"],["tha-ap163:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap163:1.1","padumo nāma nāmenā",0,0],["tha-ap163:1.1","padumo",0,1],["tha-ap163:1.3","abhinikkhamma",0,2],["tha-ap163:1.3","pavanā",0,2]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
